      <scope classrefs="object" doc="Base class for server classes. Methods for the caller:  - __init__(server_address, RequestHandlerClass) - serve_forever(poll_interval=0.5) - shutdown() - handle_request()  # if you do not use serve_forever() - fileno() -&gt; int   # for select()  Methods that may be overridden: " ilk="class" line="150" lineend="339" name="BaseServer">
