    <scope doc="Support for regular expressions (RE). This module provides regular expression matching operations similar to those found in Perl.  It supports both 8-bit and Unicode strings; both the pattern and the strings being processed can contain null bytes and characters outside the US ASCII range.  Regular expressions can contain both special and ordinary characters. Most ordinary characters, like &quot;A&quot;, &quot;a&quot;, or &quot;0&quot;, are the simplest regular expressions; they simply match themselves.  You can concatenate ordinary characters, so last matches the string &apos;last&apos;. " ilk="blob" lang="Python3" name="re">
