    <scope doc="An FTP client class and some helper functions. Based on RFC 959: File Transfer Protocol (FTP), by J. Postel and J. Reynolds  Example:  &gt;&gt;&gt; from ftplib import FTP &gt;&gt;&gt; ftp = FTP(&apos;ftp.python.org&apos;) # connect to host, default port &gt;&gt;&gt; ftp.login() # default, i.e.: user anonymous, passwd anonymous@ &apos;230 Guest login ok, access restrictions apply.&apos; &gt;&gt;&gt; ftp.retrlines(&apos;LIST&apos;) # list directory contents total 9" ilk="blob" lang="Python3" name="ftplib">
