    <scope doc="distutils.errors Provides exceptions used by the Distutils modules.  Note that Distutils modules may raise standard exceptions; in particular, SystemExit is usually raised for errors that are obviously the end-user&apos;s fault (eg. bad command-line arguments).  This module is safe to use in &quot;from ... import *&quot; mode; it only exports symbols whose names start with &quot;Distutils&quot; and end with &quot;Error&quot;." ilk="blob" lang="Python3" name="distutils.errors">
