    <scope doc="Fixer for except statements with named exceptions. The following cases will be converted:  - &quot;except E, T:&quot; where T is a name:  except E as T:  - &quot;except E, T:&quot; where T is not a name, tuple or list:  except E as t: T = t" ilk="blob" lang="Python3" name="lib2to3.fixes.fix_except">
